OLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":4256252170,"text":"他のことはよく分からないけど、大人たちはいつもこう言ってるよ…","nextNodeIds":[722250308]},{"nodeId":722250308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":321714482,"text":"「三の法則」って。","nextNodeIds":[722250309]},{"nodeId":722250309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":444891730,"text":"三の法則…どういう意味だ？","nextNodeIds":[722250310]},{"nodeId":722250310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":2315047562,"text":"えっと…どんなことでも、同じことを三回やらないと結果が分からないって意味だったかな。","nextNodeIds":[722250311]},{"nodeId":722250311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":2641393466,"text":"例えば、吉兆が三回現れれば幸運が訪れる。その反対に、凶兆が三回現れると必ず悪いことが起こるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722250312]},{"nodeId":722250312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":3640114522,"text":"何かをやる時も、三回困難に遭遇したら四回目は成功できるってことだね。","nextNodeIds":[722250313]},{"nodeId":722250313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2648828698,"text":"でも、それなら「四の法則」じゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[722250314]},{"nodeId":722250314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":572095474,"text":"あ、そっか！パイモンは算数が得意だね！","nextNodeIds":[722250315]},{"nodeId":722250315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2775756602,"text":"ふふん、当然だろ。","nextNodeIds":[722250316,722250318]},{"nodeId":722250316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1528500290,"text":"重要なところはそこじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[722250317]},{"nodeId":722250317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2296643434,"text":"ところで、クのケガは大丈夫なのか？","nextNodeIds":[722250319]},{"nodeId":722250319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":3762191234,"text":"心配いらないよ。クお兄ちゃんはいつもこうなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722250320]},{"nodeId":722250320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20449,"speakerName":"ク","textMapHash":678537994,"text":"恥ずかしい限りだが…祭典に影響がないことを祈ってる。","nextNodeIds":[722250321]},{"nodeId":722250321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20449,"speakerName":"ク","textMapHash":1151799010,"text":"じゃないと、ルーに申し訳が立たない。","nextNodeIds":[722250322]},{"nodeId":722250322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":1946217050,"text":"そんなことないよ。クお兄ちゃんはいつも僕に良くしてくれてるでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[722250323]},{"nodeId":722250323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20449,"speakerName":"ク","textMapHash":3285910130,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[722250324]},{"nodeId":722250324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":3923413202,"text":"#{NICKNAME}{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTERA]}、パイモン、先に行ってて。","nextNodeIds":[722250325]},{"nodeId":722250325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"ルー","textMapHash":1106302930,"text":"僕はもう少しクお兄ちゃんのそばにいるよ。それから、奉納の後処理もしないと。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722250318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3462778034,"text":"クのケガについて…","nextNodeIds":[722250319]}]},{"talkId":7222506,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk"